	/// Identifies the dispatched technician for the service request. Governed definition (DP-SVCPERF): <div>Field service performance product covering service requests, technician utilization, equipment failure rates, SLA attainment, and call-center first call resolution - used for daily field-ops dashboards and quarterly SLA reviews.</div>
	column TechnicianId
		dataType: int64
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 22904e29-2741-492a-a4c5-745ce6ab0472
