	/// Indicates whether the service request breached the governed service-level target. Governed definition (GT-SLA): <div>The contracted or policy-defined response and resolution targets per service-request priority and service zone. Targets are governed by the Service Delivery domain and require approval before publication.</div>
	column IsSlaBreachFlag
		dataType: int64
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 8136adbf-388d-4dc3-bbcf-61c04ed7ede4
